{"title":"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 24","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Triangle\" title=\"Triangle\">Triangle</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/2/8f2d7232554ee892487761ea219eb5eefbcfd4a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle C = 60^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"79\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/5/c95c180b12878c1f359607e0af47b48fcf4950d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"62\" height=\"13\" />.  Point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> is the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Midpoint\" title=\"Midpoint\">midpoint</a> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />.  What is the largest possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/a/54a35df05bc75683a9a61066cb7291c841b1f41a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan{\\angle BAD}$\" width=\"85\" height=\"13\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/4/2842015b8edd6b7692bd70b91b9959f04cf58ecd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{6}\\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2\\sqrt{2}}\\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{4\\sqrt{2}-3}\\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"467\" height=\"45\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/b/ddb951a2e48a00e182fdf063f5d6ab5622700c10.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy]unitsize(12mm); pair C=(0,0), B=(4 * dir(60)), A = (8,0), D=(2 * dir(60)); pair E=(1,0), F=(2,0); draw(C--B--A--C); draw(A--D);draw(D--E);draw(B--F); dot(A);dot(B);dot(C);dot(D);dot(E);dot(F); label(&quot;\\(C\\)&quot;,C,SW); label(&quot;\\(B\\)&quot;,B,N); label(&quot;\\(A\\)&quot;,A,SE); label(&quot;\\(D\\)&quot;,D,NW); label(&quot;\\(E\\)&quot;,E,S); label(&quot;\\(F\\)&quot;,F,S); label(&quot;\\(60^\\circ\\)&quot;,C+(.1,.1),ENE); label(&quot;\\(2\\)&quot;,1*dir(60),NW); label(&quot;\\(2\\)&quot;,3*dir(60),NW); label(&quot;\\(\\theta\\)&quot;,(7,.4)); label(&quot;\\(1\\)&quot;,(.5,0),S); label(&quot;\\(1\\)&quot;,(1.5,0),S); label(&quot;\\(x-2\\)&quot;,(5,0),S);[/asy]\" width=\"498\" height=\"242\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/e/44e17d8c676d1b564fe0d53d521e22086465df29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = CA$\" width=\"62\" height=\"13\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/d/15d9c68fae5f74461c5450b47213f6668dd63031.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan\\theta = \\tan(\\angle BAF - \\angle DAE)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"235\" height=\"18\" />, and since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/7/99771cca71358e003caf5735afe40ea33eb3fea4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan\\angle BAF = \\frac{2\\sqrt{3}}{x-2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"153\" height=\"41\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/d/70dcfdbca20209f1bfb4868dff2ae5dcefb6ce7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan\\angle DAE = \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{x-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"154\" height=\"41\" />, we have\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/7/0e7e40fad497d77cfc1c1273257c72565ec82619.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\tan\\theta = \\frac{\\frac{2\\sqrt{3}}{x-2} - \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{x-1}}{1 + \\frac{2\\sqrt{3}}{x-2}\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{x-1}}= \\frac{x\\sqrt{3}}{x^2-3x+8}\\]\" width=\"285\" height=\"54\" />\n</p><p>With calculus, taking the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Derivative\" title=\"Derivative\">derivative</a> and setting equal to zero will give the maximum value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/7/567744e2ef4f7e63710dfcaa23fb8f836c352a9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan \\theta$\" width=\"38\" height=\"13\" />. Otherwise, we can apply <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AM-GM\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AM-GM\">AM-GM</a>:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/0/670903a99d3d8effc4d39e818c372527fac93cb5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\frac{x^2 - 3x + 8}{x} = \\left(x + \\frac{8}{x}\\right) -3 &amp;\\geq 2\\sqrt{x \\cdot \\frac 8x} - 3 = 4\\sqrt{2} - 3\\\\ \\frac{x}{x^2 - 3x + 8} &amp;\\leq \\frac{1}{4\\sqrt{2}-3}\\\\ \\frac{x\\sqrt{3}}{x^2 - 3x + 8} = \\tan \\theta &amp;\\leq \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{4\\sqrt{2}-3}\\end{align*}\" width=\"430\" height=\"145\" />\n</p><p>Thus, the maximum is at  \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/5/195fe7c81dec521eb1d5e3e6fb76e90da186b62c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{4\\sqrt{2}-3} \\Rightarrow \\mathbf{(D)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"125\" height=\"45\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/2/d82825425db1307377b60edb9fde02896e0b02d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"49\" height=\"18\" /> is strictly increasing on the interval <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/6/a465bcb8f871e3cdcbd1f9d5bc4d377942fc9b83.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[0, \\frac{\\pi}{2})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"46\" height=\"34\" /> (if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/2/4d25f109f2648113e2eba5818b40f72e35b62bff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BAD\\ge 90^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"105\" height=\"15\" />, then it is impossible for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/3/3735b2683d9ec9e8549168e30e092151963880a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle C=60^\\circ$\" width=\"75\" height=\"13\" />), so we want to maximize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/5/cb55dc9c50a80e1d9eb23fe53e45f464c0ac755e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BAD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"59\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p>Consider the circumcircle of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/5/7e538978649c14e1616fac744e983b5981d0ea8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BAD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> and let it meet <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> again at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />. Any point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> on line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> is inside this circle, so it follows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/5/e75d7552727f6a0338960fd87c129fa8872917a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BPD&gt;\\angle BAD$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"137\" height=\"13\" />. Therefore to maximize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/5/cb55dc9c50a80e1d9eb23fe53e45f464c0ac755e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BAD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"59\" height=\"14\" />, the circumcircle of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/5/7e538978649c14e1616fac744e983b5981d0ea8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BAD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> must be tangent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />. By PoP we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/2/5d2c1e12ecd4ebb792328523e9495d3c9766e366.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CA^2=CD\\cdot CB \\Rightarrow AC = 2\\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"246\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Now our computations are straightforward:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/f/dcff624a0cc256fad91f496abb71bf1423cdbe39.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\tan\\angle BAD = \\frac{\\sin \\angle BAD}{\\cos \\angle BAD} = \\frac{\\frac{2\\sin\\angle ABD}{AD}}{\\frac{AB^2+AD^2-BD^2}{2AB\\cdot AD}}\\]\" width=\"332\" height=\"49\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/9/da9e6eee652ee13abafd44c2c7a45fd765377a70.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[=\\frac{4\\sin \\angle ABD\\cdot AB}{AB^2+AD^2-4} = \\frac{4 AC \\sin \\angle ACB}{AB^2 + AD^2 - 4}\\]\" width=\"310\" height=\"39\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/d/ffd86fe9e02826f6e7fbc70a053486f19f91b67b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[=\\frac{4\\sqrt{6}}{(4^2+(2\\sqrt{2})^2-4\\cdot 2\\sqrt{2}) + (2^2+(2\\sqrt{2})^2 - 2\\cdot 2\\sqrt{2}) - 4} = \\frac{4\\sqrt{6}}{32-12\\sqrt{2}}\\]\" width=\"556\" height=\"47\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/f/38ff92185ce27b5ff61a940cf18d9d32283cd288.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[=\\boxed{\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{4\\sqrt{2}-3}}\\]\" width=\"98\" height=\"57\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A\">2008 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 25\">Problem 25</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 12 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 12 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017200121\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.038 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 291/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2298/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 158/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8279/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.350      1 -total\n 60.87%    8.126      1 Template:AMC12_box\n 37.50%    5.007      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:6492:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017200121 and revision id 94982. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}